      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从今天起，\n我将跟中山庆典一起展开\n迈向闪耀系列赛的训练！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6398b07c5954e362f34b283a999c7d05549af171a5b21e307552674527985a05",
