    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3dcfc7d7fc189079497bf0f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一般来说根本没机会获胜。越认真使出全力，\n只会被迫面对双方之间的差距而陷入绝望。\n但是在那场比赛中──",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e28e087fa493b7b958868881265a587bec3e02a6f2603d98fa115109a6cf7fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
